WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,830
You stay away

2
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:02,440
My head is afraid of exploding if I do this.

3
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:04,640
Even if there is an immortal fist in front of me

4
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:15,960
I also have to catch a mouse first and try the salted egg. It’s okay. It’s more than 20,000 times.

5
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:17,280
Enough for the giant beast to run for a long time

6
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:19,080
It’s more than enough to travel across the province

7
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:20,920
Last time I knocked down the entire parking lot.

8
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:22,360
Tired and exhausted, only a few thousand sounds

9
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:26,480
This time I took out a small gas station and walked back to eat.

10
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:33,220
I'm back

11
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:34,340
The rice is almost cold

12
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:38,980
Su Hao used his mind power

13
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:40,900
I paid more than 20,000 yuan for gasoline from a gas station

14
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:42,440
Twenty thousand voices

15
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:43,550
How long

16
00:00:43,710 --> 00:00:45,060
Can make giant beasts run for a long time

17
00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:46,380
Sufficient for crossing emergency areas

18
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:48,900
We used to cum a few thousand times a day and a half

19
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:51,020
I'm so tired, but there's something else I need to do

20
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:53,780
Something's not right about those zombies at the wet market
